## Testing
- [ ] All existing tests pass (`npm test`)
- [ ] New tests added for new functionality
- [ ] Manual testing performed (describe below)
- [ ] Build succeeds (`npm run make`)

## Manual Testing Performed
```
# Commands run and expected output
```

## Checklist
- [ ] Code follows project style (run `npm run lint`)
- [ ] Self-review completed
- [ ] Comments added for complex logic
- [ ] SPEC.md updated if protocol changed
- [ ] Documentation updated if user-facing
- [ ] No breaking changes without version bump
- [ ] Conventional commit messages used

## Screenshots / Demo
If applicable, add screenshots or asciinema recording.

## Additional Notes
Any other context, concerns, or discussion points.